Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:07.58,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,465.6)}Episode 51\N\N\N\N\NRighteous Release of Yan Yan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All this trouble from bad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.98,0:01:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get some fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get caught by General Zhang, he will flog us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.49,0:01:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In this heat, is it so wrong to pick some fruits?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I be losing my head for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.35,0:01:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.99,0:01:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't go! You cannot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let them ruin our orange trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die? Those are men of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My orange trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.53,0:01:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of you will come out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you before,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,this is no ordinary expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed to \Nsteal from the people!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.09,0:02:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But you two had the audacity \Nto violate military order!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.01,0:02:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,General...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.26,0:02:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What punishment do you deserve?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,General, general!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.06,0:02:37.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.667,501.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,375,2740,3060)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.51,0:02:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What punishment!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.26,0:02:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve... I deserve forty strokes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.51,0:03:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You two have violated the military law.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, you almost made me violate \Nthe orders of the Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I will write this down for\N the moment and stop whipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do this again, \Nyou will both be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up and return the fruits!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your mercy, general, thank you-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.35,0:03:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, whoever \Ndares violate my military orders
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and steals from the people will be put to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.49,0:03:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I clear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.03,0:03:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We hear you loud and clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.37,0:03:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,March!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.52,0:04:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose army is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that they are \Nunder Imperial Uncle Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Good men! What good men!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Nice archery!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you are great with \Nboth the sword and bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your might has not weakened over time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If our lord declined Zhang Song's plan to invite Liu Bei into Shu-lands,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,how could our passes\N and land be lost now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:40.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996,494)\fade(255,0,255,0,375,3380,3740)}Yán Yán
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Leading wolves into our households, we sought this disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei's army is encamped north of Ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They have arrived so swiftly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He maintained discipline in his army,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:05:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,he did not ravage any lands that capitulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the passes \Nsurrendered upon seeing his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.63,0:05:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will weaken his streak here in Ba Commandery!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.09,0:05:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Get my horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.27,0:05:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, from what I heard, \NZhang Fei is extraordinarily valiant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When he was alone at Changban slope,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,his yell frightened Xiahou Jie of the Cao army
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so much, that it made his organs bleed and he fell from his horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The million strong army of Cao Cao all fell apart immediately, fled at the sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you have an important responsibility. Do not take such a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You should strengthen \Nthe walls and avoid confrontation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarding the city is not impossible,\N but as Zhang Fei has led his army here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.95,0:05:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,he would not retreat so easily. \NSooner or later, we will have to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.03,0:05:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They came from afar, so they cannot maintain their supply lines well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, Zhang Fei has a very short temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Once provoked, he will chug wine \Nand vent his anger by flogging his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This will cause a mutiny, \Nand we need only exploit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.37,0:06:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this not twice the reward\N with half the effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Since my entry into Shu, ten of\N the passes in our way have surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it that guards this city?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And how dare he resist us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.18,0:06:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,According to intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the Administrator of Ba Commandery is Yan Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.61,0:06:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Although he is over sixty, he can still pull a war bow and wield a glaive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even ten thousand men cannot compare!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.69,0:06:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He announced that even if you entered the Riverlands, you could not enter Ba Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That old fool dares\N speak such nonsense?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a messenger into\N the city to speak to Yan Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Zhang Fei want to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang said that upon entry, \NI should tell the old fool Yan Yan
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,to surrender the city right now\N for the people to be given mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:07:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, we shall raze the city \Nand slay each and every person!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You pompous scoundrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.22,0:07:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Restrain him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.30,0:07:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Envoys cannot be touched during war!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell this to that fool Zhang Fei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The warriors of the Riverlands would \Nlose their heads than be on their knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut his ears and nose off \Nand throw him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,General, general!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan Yan, you old fool!\N Can you only bully but one foot soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have any guys, come out of the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Come have a taste of the Serpent Spear of your sir Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us guard the city \Nand watch their next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.71,0:08:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan Yan, you old fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Loosen the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Old fool, what sort of ability \Nis shooting arrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are a real man, \Ncome out and duel me to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Loosen the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.73,0:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I should laugh at this sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei has pretended to be relaxed and carefree for several days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He thinks using such an \Ninane trick can lure me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How risible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he is so anxious to fight,\Nhe is obviously short on supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.12,0:09:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems being a turtle withdrawn into its shell is a worthy pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.45,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is infuriating!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, bring me wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, did you not pledge to the Strategos,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,not to drink during the campaign in Shu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.85,0:10:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This old fool Yan Yan is obnoxious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I take any more of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry! Get me some wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.74,0:10:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This jar of fine wine has been kept for years, but it is all gone due to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.53,0:11:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.35,0:11:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare my life, general!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will pay you back for this later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.87,0:11:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him to the foot of the city wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.25,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be losing it \Nsince we refuse to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if we take this chance \Nand attack him, we will succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is one of his schemes. Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.25,0:12:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it not be better to \Nsee them struggle even more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are the musicians here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As you ordered, they are already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Tell them to play music and tell the soldiers to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan Yan you old fool, if you are a true man, come out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and fight hundred bouts with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, you fool! Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.06,0:12:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I urge you to return to Jing Province so you can avoid dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.05,0:13:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, the foot of \Nthis city will serve as your grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.57,0:13:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan Yan, you old fool! \NHurry and open the gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you force me to breach the city,\N I will slaughter you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.47,0:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You old fool, when I catch you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I will peel off your skin \Nand take your flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.96,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a stupid old senile!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Loosen the arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Pour wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.15,0:13:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, Zhang Fei has not \Ncome out to fight us for two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.52,0:14:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,May he be plotting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei is just a brute with trivial ploys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What trick could he conjure up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.18,0:14:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But, we have witnessed soldiers cutting firewood at the hills outside for the last two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.49,0:14:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We do not know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.02,0:14:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been aware of this for some time as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Those soldiers are scouting out paths while pretending to cut firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.54,0:14:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It is clear that Zhang Fei is thinking of using a small road to bypass us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.97,0:14:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei is asking for trouble\N by fighting a battle of wits with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does not want to go through us,\N he has to use a narrow road west here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.84,0:14:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That road leads right to Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.41,0:15:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That small road can be\N our bait, then we can trap him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.29,0:15:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To trap him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send a good spy to infiltrate \Nhis camp and find out what he is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterwards...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This knife will be used\N to slice into Yan Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan Yan, you old fool,\N I will consume you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.78,0:15:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We just found a suspicious\N fellow during a patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.80,0:15:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He was lurking everywhere, \Nso he must be a spy from our foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.94,0:15:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We have brought him here\N for you to decide his fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A spy for Yan Yan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.37,0:15:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.52,0:15:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come! Bring me some wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.54,0:15:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,General...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Do not delay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.45,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Move! Move faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring the wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Very fine wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.67,0:16:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I am no spy!\N I am an ordinary man from the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,An ordinary man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know everyone in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.50,0:16:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How come... I never met you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.23,0:17:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, sir, it is true you never met me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I am an ordinary man from the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you are no ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you are Yan Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I intend to peel off your skin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and feast on your flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.85,0:17:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,General, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I hear that you treat\N people as if your own children!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You never killed innocents!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It is that senile Yan Yan! He took away all the food in the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was desperate and\N snuck into the camp just to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I beg you to spare my life! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a good man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am a good man! A good man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.40,0:18:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.36,0:18:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.50,0:18:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you will follow a military unit...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,climb the western hills\N and get some firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to! I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.93,0:19:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey folks, what are ya talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What, the road, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The road around Ba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.58,0:19:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, it's useless to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it's useless? \NThis guy's a native around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he's our lifeline!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.97,0:19:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, can you tell us\N if there's a road around Ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not my place to say.\N If the old general at the city hears of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.57,0:19:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna be eating much afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all in this to eat!\N Ain't no one gonna rat on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I will do you guys a favor, I will tell it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.53,0:19:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't mention that I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a narrow road at the foot of this hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Use it to avoid Ba and get to Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a lot of vegetation \Nand wild thorns there, hard to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So what? Just report it to \Nthe general, he'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To take the road or not is his decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we'll avoid a whipping, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go and have a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were chopping wood,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,did you discover any roads?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.85,0:20:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, you deserve to be \Nrewarded for finding the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.10,0:20:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That old Yan Yan is \Nsticking to his defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our supplies are not enough, \Nwe cannot be kept here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.61,0:21:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot afford to be slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You will prepare rations at second watch! We will march out at third watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:16.88,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Second watch: 21:00-23:00; third watch: 23:00-1:00
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lead the army in the front. \NThe baggage carts are to be behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire army will circumvent Ba Commandery and march to Luocheng with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that fool would become impatient!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.49,0:21:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare food in the second watch and march out in the third watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will wait for him by \Nthe narrow road west of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.63,0:22:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,General, give orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.08,0:22:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let him pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.69,0:22:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.69,0:22:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for his baggage carts to come,\N then we will go out and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.06,0:22:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The van and rear will be \Nunable to aid each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.08,0:22:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I will capture Zhang Fei alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.66,0:22:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat the drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.10,0:23:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan Yan, you old fool, Zhang Fei is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.33,0:24:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan Yan, you old fool, \Nyou fell into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.00,0:24:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I pretended to be confused so as to confuse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.96,0:24:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The fake Zhang was \Nfollowed by the real Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.82,0:24:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.62,0:24:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Escort that old fool Yan Yan in!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.82,0:25:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.40,0:25:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When I entered Shu, all the passes\N surrendered when they saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.38,0:25:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You are an old... an old rotten fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.86,0:25:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.02,0:25:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is a lowly betrayer, backstabbing by taking our Riverlands!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no shame whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.46,0:25:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You are all just servile dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.50,0:25:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How brazen of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.38,0:25:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Give him to me now! \NBehead him, behead him, behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.49,0:25:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Behead him! Behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.25,0:25:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to kill me, then kill me.\NIf you wish to chop me, then chop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.98,0:25:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you not done it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.01,0:25:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our land only has warriors who welcome death,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.66,0:25:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,not one who bends their knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.98,0:26:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.85,0:26:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.05,0:26:09.21,Thinking,,0,0,0,,"Warriors who welcome death, \Nnot one who bends their knees."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.21,0:26:12.20,Thinking,,0,0,0,,This old general is truly loyal and brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.16,0:26:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot afford to have you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.45,0:27:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}You are devoted and loyal. \NI have known that for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.68,0:27:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}Today, I have met you.\N How I look up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.81,0:27:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}My previous words were very reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}I hope you will forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.25,0:27:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}Please do not be bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.31,0:27:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}You are a heroic warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.47,0:27:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}yet you have long served\N the incompetent Liu Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.46,0:27:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}Your talent and ambition \Ncould not be realized then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.33,0:27:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}What a pity for you to be ignored despite all your shining talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.33,0:28:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}Imperial Uncle Liu is bold in talent \Nand he is kind to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.49,0:28:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}He has made friends with heroes \Nand he has won over the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.82,0:28:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}General, you are a minister of the Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}Why not take this opportunity to\N forsake the darkness for the light?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.11,0:28:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.74,0:28:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If me and you helped Imperial Uncle\N Liu and made achievements together,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.42,0:28:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be my fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.94,0:28:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I sincerely hope you will \Nnot leave this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.58,0:29:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I am lacking in talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.21,0:29:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but I hope you will\N lend me a helping hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.74,0:29:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I am but a defeated general. \NHow can I receive such great respect?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.64,0:29:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,General, you are so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I not devote\N my entire strength for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I passed unimpeded due to \Nall your help throughout!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.58,0:30:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide and the Strategos came to the Riverlands through different routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.34,0:30:38.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(316,518)\fade(255,0,255,0,375,6000,6340)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.96,0:30:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Never did I anticipate that Yide \Nwould arrive first by a land route!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.30,0:30:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What an extraordinary feat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.88,0:30:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I seized forty-five towns on\Nthe way from Ba Commandery to Luocheng!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.87,0:30:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,None of them put up a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.52,0:30:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I relied on the moral virtues\N and prestige Elder general Yan had.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.60,0:31:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for Elder general Yan,\N I would have lost to the Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.57,0:31:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, when you were \Nsending troops for Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.56,0:31:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I once made a bet with Yide.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.04,0:31:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Yide has won.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.30,0:31:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He will awe people to submission and\Nhe deserves to be commended!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.29,0:31:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But what a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.13,0:31:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, why the pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.97,0:31:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide, when we made our bet, we did not settle on what items would be at stake, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.38,0:31:32.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(335,388)\fade(255,0,255,0,375,2740,3100)}Zhūgé Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.58,0:31:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it not a pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.12,0:31:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, a gentleman \Nwill not betray a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.90,0:31:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not want gold or silver from you, \Nbut a jar of good wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.73,0:31:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I will drink until I am too drunk to stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.80,0:32:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Yide has peerless bravery, \Nbut now he can apply strategies as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.01,0:32:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrific blessing for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.21,0:32:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, from now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.54,0:32:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you must never become\N haughty from your merits.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.17,0:32:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, you need not worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.06,0:32:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Yan,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.70,0:32:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,had Yide not had your help, would he be able to make such great merits?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.73,0:32:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please accept my respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.06,0:32:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that was all due to his prowess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.38,0:32:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The old fool I am was late \Nto surrender. What merits have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.64,0:33:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder general, you do not\N have to be so humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.32,0:33:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This armor has been\N worn by me for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.50,0:33:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Its durability is peerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.98,0:33:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I present it to you \Nas a token of my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.89,0:33:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.66,0:33:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much,\Nmy lord, for your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.52,0:33:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder general Yan, \Nplease rise, please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.36,0:33:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare a banquet to welcome \NGeneral Yan from his journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.40,0:33:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I already sent for good wine\N to celebrate the merits Yide rendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.53,0:33:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, you do keep your words!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.70,0:33:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The army shall feast for three days,\N then prepare to attack Luocheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.20,0:33:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.72,0:34:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}Yesterday, you sent me to\N Jing Province to ally with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.57,0:34:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}I did not expect the dissent of your inner circle, which has resulted in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.43,0:34:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}Now, though, Luocheng has fallen and Zhang Ren is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.12,0:34:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}Yet, Liu Bei of Jing Province still \Nlikes you and considers you his kin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.93,0:34:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}If you submit to him now, \Nhe would never mistreat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.86,0:34:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}Please consider this very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.96,0:34:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}Fa Zheng refuses to return! \NHe betrayed me to seek out glory!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.92,0:34:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}He has fallen for the enemy now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.50,0:34:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}even telling me to surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.55,0:34:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}That ungrateful, black-hearted baseborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.46,0:34:44.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(408,498)\fade(255,0,255,0,375,4060,4420)}Liú Zhāng\NStyled: Jìyù
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.22,0:34:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.67,0:34:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei and his army\N will soon arrive at Mianzhu,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.03,0:34:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,yet none of you can think of a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.55,0:34:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.67,0:35:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Lordship, we can only haste to send someone to Hanzhong
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.46,0:35:00.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314,464)\fade(255,0,255,0,375,3340,3620)}Liú Bā\NStyled: Zǐchū
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.58,0:35:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and beg Zhang Lu to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.59,0:35:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhang Lu wants revenge \Non me for killing his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.07,0:35:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he come to my rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.84,0:35:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We can talk to him \Nabout gains and losses.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.13,0:35:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If we are in danger, \NHanzhong will be too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.49,0:35:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, we can promise \Nto repay him. He will then help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.19,0:35:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With matter standing like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.54,0:35:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.37,0:35:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.81,0:35:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That my own close kindred\N would go so far to pressure me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.04,0:35:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How difficult it is to\N discern human intentions!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.99,0:36:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Jiyu has torn apart our letter\Nand refused to submit. As I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.30,0:36:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,With such a situation, you have every\Nreason to advance towards Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.41,0:36:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Any more news?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.91,0:36:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}Someone offered Liu Zhang a plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.01,0:36:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10\pos(640,670)}to burn all food along the roads,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.88,0:36:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}lead the people of Baxi \Nand Zitong west of Fu river,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.55,0:36:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord10}fortify the walls, and \Nscorch the soil to wait us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.79,0:36:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is so, then my army is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, do not be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.54,0:36:41.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(322,514)\fade(255,0,255,0,375,3220,3540)}Fǎ Zhèng\NStyled: Xiàozhí
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.18,0:36:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Given Liu Jiyu's temperament, he would never agree to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.32,0:36:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What Xiaozhi just said is reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.62,0:36:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is so, we can\N be said to be very fortunate!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.58,0:36:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.50,0:36:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord and Strategos, \NMa Chao of Xiliang has joined Zhang Lu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.36,0:37:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He is now reinforcing \NLiu Zhang with 20,000 troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.09,0:37:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,He is attacking Jiameng Pass with ferocity,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.91,0:37:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Generals Meng Da and Huo Jun \Nhave asked for imminent help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.12,0:37:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao had been fighting\N Cao Cao in the Longxi region.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.07,0:37:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,When did he join Zhang Lu?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.45,0:37:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao is of immense courage.\N Only Zhang Fei and Zhao Yun can match him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.32,0:37:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is so, why not send \NYide to meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.37,0:37:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.81,0:37:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, do not speak to him.\NLet me rile him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.19,0:37:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.56,0:37:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother and Strategos, I hear\NMa Chao is attacking Jiameng pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.68,0:37:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always wanted\N to fight such a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.10,0:37:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother and Strategos, \Nplease let me go face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.07,0:38:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.64,0:38:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide, do not be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.63,0:38:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, what is your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.07,0:38:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao has great aptitude in combat.\N No ordinary men can match him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.69,0:38:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry and get Yunchang\N from Jing Province because he can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.07,0:38:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You love looking down\N on people such as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.82,0:38:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want Second Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.36,0:39:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Was I not the one driving back \NCao Cao's great army at Changban slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.76,0:39:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I won glory in entering the Riverlands!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.54,0:39:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,, Am I no match for Ma Chao\Nboth in wisdom and bravery?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.64,0:39:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.44,0:39:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, you did scare away Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.54,0:39:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That was only because he did not know your true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.74,0:39:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma Chao made him cut off his beard and abandon his robe at the Wei river to avoid being killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.36,0:39:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world does not respect that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.77,0:39:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I just fear even if we were to invite Yunchang here, \Neven he may not triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.55,0:39:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for that, I will have to go fight Ma Chao!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.39,0:39:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not slighting you. I am thinking for the sake of your reputation, Yide.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.34,0:40:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, I do not seek\N some empty reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.08,0:40:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to kill to my liking!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.58,0:40:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.30,0:40:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If I cannot win, let me\N be subject to the military law!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.95,0:40:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide, if you wish to sign the military pledge, \Nyou may be in the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.76,0:40:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, when you march your army out, \NI will remain here to guard Mianzhu.
Comment: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Check line above: 都混粮吃饭的，谁也卖不了你。

